  "purpose": "2021 3.74 GeV: run-by-run FEE momentum-scale correction for DATA and one run-averaged curvature smearing for MC.",
  "scale_apply": "DATA only. For each track, half = top if tanLambda > 0 else bot; k = runScale.runs[str(run)][half] (runScale.default[half] if the run is missing). Multiply px, py, pz (|p|) by k and divide omega by k. Apply before any momentum cuts / vertex quantities that use track momentum.",
